<title>USA: Boeing Co Q3 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Boeing Co Q3 earnings summary.</headline>
<text>
<p>SEATTLE, Oct 24 (Reuter)</p>
<p>		   Sept 30  1996		Sept 30 1995</p>
<p> Shr		 0.74		     0.66</p>
<p> Net		 254,000		  225,000</p>
<p> Revs		5,601,000		4,381,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  343,500		  342,500</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $2.44		    $0.51</p>
<p> Net		 841,000		  175,000</p>
<p> Revs		16,169,000	     14,976,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  344,600		  341,800</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note - Q3 1996 First Call earnings estimate: $0.73 a share.</p>
<p>1995 nine months net includes impact of $600 million pretax charge related to a special retirement program in the second quarter of 1995. Sales for the nine months ended September 30, 1996, included the sale of certain aircraft previously on operating lease.</p>
</text>
